We'll create a view that shows EQ bars. We'll use a SwiftUI `View` with `@StateObject` holding a `VisualizerEngine`. The engine updates every 50ms using a `Task`. It will generate estimated levels per band based on elapsed time and simulate audio. When not recording, bars are dim.

